WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.038
The highest common factor is the largest number that divides both numbers. Factor

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.899
trees and prime factors help.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:13.247
Find HCF(10, 15). The answer is 5. Highest common factor equals 5.

00:00:14.117 --> 00:00:20.334
Two groups during a sports day hold 32 and 15 items. What is the greatest size of

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:24.357
identical packets that divides both totals? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:31.581
Two groups during a sports day hold 32 and 15 items. What is the greatest size of

00:00:31.581 --> 00:00:36.460
identical packets that divides both totals? The answer is 1. Highest common factor

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:37.211
equals 1.
